## 953: Six Even-Power Radicals

Tasks covered: all six calculations with the nonnegative root.

- **a)** \(\sqrt{10^6}=\sqrt{(10^3)^2}=|1000|=\mathbf{1000}\).
- **b)** \(\sqrt{(-2)^6}=\sqrt{((-2)^3)^2}=|-8|=\mathbf8\).
