Tasks covered: all four complete real solution sets and endpoint inclusion.

- **a)** \(|x|\ge1\iff x\le-1\) or \(x\ge1\).
  **\((-\infty,-1]\cup[1,\infty)\)**.
- **b)** \(|x|<2\iff-2<x<2\).
